==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 3.33~13.33 seconds<sup>100f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 5~6.67 seconds<sup>150f~200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Croco]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 160 seconds<sup>4,800f</sup>, delay 30~60 seconds<sup>900f~1,800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 200 seconds<sup>6,000f</sup>, delay 30~60 seconds<sup>900f~1,800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 30~60 seconds<sup>900f~1,800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Hippoe]]s spawn after 120 seconds<sup>3,600f</sup>, delay 30~60 seconds<sup>900f~1,800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Pigge]]s spawn after 120 seconds<sup>3,600f</sup>, delay 30~60 seconds<sup>900f~1,800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Send out a few [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Tank Cats]] as you upgrade your [[Worker Cat]] to max level. When the first Croco appears, send out [[Axe Cat (Normal Cat)|Axe Cat]] with some meatshields. Now, wait for your money to go up. By the time Jackie Peng comes out, you should be able to send out all of your units at once. After that, keep spamming meatshields, [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Gross Cats]] and [[Bird Cat (Normal Cat)|Bird Cats]]. If you have some treasures and a decent level of the Worker Cat Rate, you can rush this stage by spamming Axe Cats and [[Ninja Cat (Special Cat)|Ninja Cats]].

